    Diagnostic.error("E1270", "adapter package declaration is not complete", "`Pkg.adapt` needs `name:`, `source:`, and a supported `recipe:`; recipes are `Recipe.copy()`, `Recipe.prebuilt(bin:, as:)`, or a finite `Recipe.build(steps: […])`.", "write `Pkg.adapt(name: \"tool\", source: \"./vendor/tool\", recipe: Recipe.copy())`.", None)
